# A Mountain makes Canyon Wildcat unblockable until Crevasse enters; the same blocker can then block it (CR 702.14c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Canyon Wildcat
Mountain x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Crevasse
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Canyon Wildcat.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Canyon Wildcat)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Canyon Wildcat)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Crevasse.Cast
? Bot2.Mana =
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Canyon Wildcat)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Canyon Wildcat)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot2.Graveyard.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Canyon Wildcat.Power = 2
